{
  "esm": "2.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "cdeps_templates",
    "description": "Expression-template library for the CDEPS DATM data-atmosphere component: the pointwise forcing-derivation laws of the CLMNCEP datamode (datm/datm_datamode_clmncep_mod.F90, cdeps1.0.112) and of the stream time interpolation (streams/dshr_strdata_mod.F90, streams/dshr_tinterp_mod.F90), transcribed exactly for use by the DATM component (cdeps_datm_gswp3.esm). The library carries (a) the saturation vapor pressure esat of datm_eSat (clmncep F90:545-586): the water a0..a6 and ice b0..b6 polynomials evaluated by Horner's rule in degrees C on t = clamp(tK - TKFRZ, -50, 50), phase selected by tKbot < TKFRZ (ice) vs >= (water), result in hPa x100 = Pa; (b) the saturation specific humidity qsat = eps e / (pbot - eps1 e) (F90:410,415,422) with eps = 0.622 and eps1 = 1 - eps = 0.378 (the molecular-weight-ratio pair of water vapor to dry air); (c) the vapor pressure vp = q pbot / (eps + eps1 q) and air density rho = (pbot - eps1 vp) / (tbot RDAIR) with RDAIR = 287.0423113650487 (F90:428-429, SHR_CONST_RDAIR = AVOGAD*BOLTZ/MWDAIR); (d) the shortwave direct/diffuse ratios ratio_rvrf of the cam3_5_55-based polynomials (F90:450-456): NIR 0.29548 + 0.00504 s - 1.4957e-5 s^2 + 1.4881e-8 s^3 and VIS 0.17639 + 0.00380 s - 9.0039e-6 s^2 + 8.1351e-9 s^3, both clamped to [0.01, 0.99], where s is the half shortwave (s = swdn/2 = swndr = swvdr); (e) the rain/snow ramp fraction frac = clamp((T - TKFRZ)*0.5, 0, 1) of shr_precip_partition_rain_snow_ramp (share/shr_precip_mod.F90:17-45); (f) the horizontal wind split u = v = wind/sqrt(2) (F90:402-403); and (g) the coszen time-interpolation geometry of the stream layer: the solar declination of shr_orb_decl (share/src/shr_orb_mod.F90:736-814, as orb_lambm / orb_lamb / orb_decl), the clipped cosine of the solar zenith angle of shr_tInterp_getCosz (streams/dshr_tinterp_mod.F90:313-318, orb_cosz), and the lower record time t_lb = t0 + dt floor((t - t0)/dt) of a regular record axis (record_lower_time). The shared constants are factored as zero-parameter fragments: tkfrz = 273.15 K (the TKFRZ of the esat phase branch and the rain/snow ramp) and the molecular-weight-ratio pair eps = 0.622, eps1 = 1 - eps = 0.378 of the qsat/vapor-pressure/density laws; the polynomial coefficients and the ramp slope stay as literals. All laws are pointwise; the DATM model applies them per mesh point with stream values (LB/UB + interpolation factors at the streams layer; interpolated values at the datamode layer) from the GSWP3v1 data_sources, and the component's tests pin them to CDEPS instrumentation dumps of a reference CESM I2000Clm60Sp_f19 run (cdeps_strdata_streams.csv, datm_gswp3_streams.csv, datm_gswp3_exports.csv; see the component README for provenance).",
    "tags": [
      "data_models",
      "cdeps",
      "datm",
      "data-atmosphere",
      "expression-templates",
      "cesm"
    ],
    "created": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z",
    "authors": [
      "EqESM project contributors"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "CESM (Community Earth System Model), ESCOMP/CDEPS: Common Data model EXchange Platform source (cdeps1.0.112) - datm/datm_datamode_clmncep_mod.F90, streams/dshr_strdata_mod.F90, streams/dshr_tinterp_mod.F90, share/shr_precip_mod.F90, share/shr_const_mod.F90 - the reference implementation these components are transcribed from.",
        "url": "https://github.com/ESCOMP/CDEPS"
      },
      {
        "citation": "EarthSciModels - the authoritative .esm corpus this component lives in.",
        "url": "https://github.com/EarthSciML/EarthSciModels"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_templates": {
    "esat_poly_water": {
      "description": "Saturation vapor pressure over water, a0..a6 polynomial of datm_eSat (datm_datamode_clmncep_mod.F90:553-560, 585-586) evaluated by Horner's rule: e = a0 + t (a1 + t (a2 + t (a3 + t (a4 + t (a5 + t a6))))), t in degrees C (the caller clamps to [-50, 50] and selects the phase), result in hPa (multiply by 100 for Pa).",
      "params": [
        "t"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": 6.107799961,
            "units": "Pa"
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "t",
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "const",
                    "args": [],
                    "value": 0.4436518521,
                    "units": "Pa/K"
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "t",
                      {
                        "op": "+",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "const",
                            "args": [],
                            "value": 0.01428945805,
                            "units": "Pa/K^2"
                          },
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              "t",
                              {
                                "op": "+",
                                "args": [
                                  {
                                    "op": "const",
                                    "args": [],
                                    "value": 0.0002650648471,
                                    "units": "Pa/K^3"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "op": "*",
                                    "args": [
                                      "t",
                                      {
                                        "op": "+",
                                        "args": [
                                          {
                                            "op": "const",
                                            "args": [],
                                            "value": 3.031240396e-06,
                                            "units": "Pa/K^4"
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "op": "*",
                                            "args": [
                                              "t",
                                              {
                                                "op": "+",
                                                "args": [
                                                  {
                                                    "op": "const",
                                                    "args": [],
                                                    "value": 2.034080948e-08,
                                                    "units": "Pa/K^5"
                                                  },
                                                  {
                                                    "op": "*",
                                                    "args": [
                                                      "t",
                                                      {
                                                        "op": "const",
                                                        "args": [],
                                                        "value": 6.136820929e-11,
                                                        "units": "Pa/K^6"
                                                      }
                                                    ]
                                                  }
                                                ]
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "esat_poly_ice": {
      "description": "Saturation vapor pressure over ice, b0..b6 polynomial of datm_eSat (datm_datamode_clmncep_mod.F90:562-569, 582-583) evaluated by Horner's rule: e = b0 + t (b1 + t (b2 + t (b3 + t (b4 + t (b5 + t b6))))), t in degrees C (the caller clamps to [-50, 50] and selects the phase), result in hPa (multiply by 100 for Pa).",
      "params": [
        "t"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "+",
